    "scope": "Eight typed scientific-file operations and their nested records, including local MPI read/write, captured-file lifecycle and product delivery. The dated completion review records independent whole-inventory findings, evidence and reviewed boundaries; multi-node correctness and scaling remain future work under the accepted local-MPI v1 scope.",
